.TH FLOOR 3M
.SH NAME
fabs, floor, ceil \- absolute value, floor, ceiling functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B "#include <math.h>"
.sp
.B "double floor(x)"
.B "double x;"
.sp
.B "double ceil(x)"
.B "double x;"
.sp
.B "double fabs(x)"
.B "double x;"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fabs
returns the absolute value
.RI | x |.
.PP
.B floor
returns the largest integer not greater than
.IR x .
.PP
.B ceil
returns the smallest integer not less than
.IR x .
.SH "SEE ALSO"
abs(3)
.sp
